    "body": "<!-- claude-projects-attribution: {\"github_login\":\"siainbuletin\"} -->\n_Requested by **Sia** · [project thread](https://claude.ai/code/project/chan_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2?thread=cmsg_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2Cso4WAZSWbQutHMvcAniFJ)_\n\n## What\n\nThe nightly tidy of `CHANGELOG.org` (in `emacs-modular/.config/emacs-modular/` since the Stow move).\n\n- **Being developed**: dropped the finished \"Tangle check\" lines (#258, #273); merged the three \"Emacs hangs at start\" lines into one that says everything is merged but the cause is not confirmed; brought the Stow line up to date (#271, #272, #274 merged) and the SVG-chips line (#261 and #264 merged, #276 open).\n- **Startup, load order and configuration hygiene**: one line each for #261, #263, #264, #265, #266, #267, #268, #270, in the order they landed.\n- **Module docs and layout**: one line each for #251, #253, #257, #258, #273 (the tangle fixes). Both sets' date ranges now end on 2026-11-03.\n- **Module docs**: new or extended \"Changes by pull request\" sections in `sp-vault-perf`, `sp-ai`, `sp-tab-inbox`, `sp-terminal`, `sp-vulpea` and `sp-dashboard` carry the detail of #268, #267, #265, #261 and #270.\n\n## Left out on purpose\n\n- #275, #276 and #278 are open and add their own lines when they merge.\n- #255 (beets) and #225 (iPod) are not Emacs config; #225 sits on #171's branch.\n- #269 and #277 were closed without merging.\n\nOnly prose changed, no code blocks, so the `tangle` check should be unaffected. Not run in Emacs (none in the container).\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiAhURtzPFib2Qr56NG)_",
