                "message": "CHANGELOG: nightly tidy for 2026-11-03\n\nMove the finished Tangle-check entries (#258, #273) and the startup-hang\npull requests (#261, #263 to #268, #270) into their feature sets, add #251,\n#253 and #257 to Module docs and layout, merge the three \"Emacs hangs at\nstart\" lines into one, bring the Stow and SVG-chip lines up to date, and\nput the verbose text in the \"Changes by pull request\" sections of the\nmodule docs.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiAhURtzPFib2Qr56NG",
